- bibs non-blank handled by Bean Validation (@NotBlank) but service also runs when called directly in tests — add null/blank checks? Bean validation only runs at controller. Service-level tests call service directly. Existing code validates in service (e.g. validateCheckpointDefinitions). I'll validate counts and duplicates in service; blank check via def.groupCode() — duplicates check with a set; blank groupCode would just be a weird value. For robustness add blank checks → BadRequest.

